    <title>Disappeared</title>
    <desc>Here today, gone tomorrow. Thousands of people go missing in the United States each year, leaving behind only a mystery without any clues. Their stories are told in `Disappeared&apos; through the voices of family, friends and investigators trying to solve the case, with each hourlong episode recounting the final stages that led to a person&apos;s disappearance. Interviews with experts including psychologists and forensic specialists provide new insights into what may have happened - whether foul play was involved or the subject simply ran away.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
