    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831074000 +0530" stop="20260831080500 +0530" channel="3434">
    <title>Who the (Bleep) Did I Marry?</title>
    <desc>Telling the real stories of men and women who lived happy, seemingly normal lives with the people they loved - and who they thought they knew. When a clue or mishap causes them to dig further into the secret lives of their spouses, the shocking truths lead them to wonder who it is they really fell in love with. The stories include husbands with multiple families, spies working under cover, those who steal thousands of dollars, and others whose double lives include murder.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831080500 +0530" stop="20260831090100 +0530" channel="3434">
    <title>Web of Lies</title>
    <desc>An exploration into the dangers of meeting up with strangers through Internet dating sites. Featuring stories from families and friends of victims who have fallen victim to online predators.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831090100 +0530" stop="20260831095700 +0530" channel="3434">
    <title>Blood Relatives</title>
    <desc>From the outside, families seem like harmonious units in loving homes. But you don&apos;t necessarily know what secrets families are hiding from the outside world. This series, narrated by actress Brenda Strong, explores families hiding the most extreme of family secrets: murder. Each episode explores a death in a family, unravelling the motives of the family members, all of whom are potential suspects - and potential victims. Sibling rivalries, disputes over family businesses and infidelity are some of the factors that lead to the families&apos; ultimate betrayals.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831095700 +0530" stop="20260831105300 +0530" channel="3434">
    <title>Alien Encounters: Fact or Fiction</title>
    <desc>UFO experts Mitch Horowitz and Chrissy Newton use scientific data and research to dissect real-life encounters with extraterrestrial activity and determine whether they can be explained.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831105300 +0530" stop="20260831112100 +0530" channel="3434">
    <title>Who the (Bleep) Did I Marry?</title>
    <desc>Telling the real stories of men and women who lived happy, seemingly normal lives with the people they loved - and who they thought they knew. When a clue or mishap causes them to dig further into the secret lives of their spouses, the shocking truths lead them to wonder who it is they really fell in love with. The stories include husbands with multiple families, spies working under cover, those who steal thousands of dollars, and others whose double lives include murder.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831112100 +0530" stop="20260831114900 +0530" channel="3434">
    <title>Redrum</title>
    <desc>As its title implies, `Redrum&apos; works in reverse. The true crime series flips the script of traditional mystery programming by starting the stories at the scene of the crimes and working backward to reveal the killers. Told with the help of interviews with friends and family close to the victim - and sometimes even the killer - each story integrates the interviews with stylised re-creations to show how investigators piece together a case, tracing a series of intersecting events and relationships that unfolded to arrive at the root of the crime.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831114900 +0530" stop="20260831124500 +0530" channel="3434">
